@format 1
@id audio.select-step
@title Select audio processing step
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Select one audio processing row or the No Processing row, display its inspector, and clear an active skip setting when an actual step is selected.
@section I. UI
@tabs Audio
@flow TB
@related audio.toggle-step

@alias processing = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PProcessing
@alias inspector = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PInspector
@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PAudioTab

[input] Processing row selected <input>
- Handle a processing-row press or No Processing-row activation @ processing.PProcessingRowBuild(...)
@ processing.PProcessingSkipBuild(...)
> select

[select] Select and reveal step <process>
- Mark the selected row and raise the selected step event @ processing.PProcessingSelectApply(...)
- Show the matching inspector body and unminimize it @ inspector.PInspectorStepShow(...)
> skip

[skip] Reconcile skip state <decision>
- Clear persistent and active skip state only when an actual audio step was selected @ tab.PAudioStepHandle(...)
? "No Processing remains selected" > result
? "An audio step is selected" > result

[result] Processing editor selected <output>
= The selected audio editor is visible; selecting a real step cannot leave No Processing active.
